		{"id":"9fcb2045db6af510","type":"text","text":"Hierarchy of the nobles \n\nThose with political power\n\nAchilles Volstar - Brother to Ceasar but no where near as powerful, in charge of foreign intelligence and discreet operations.\n\nAlivia Divina - most powerful mage of this era and familiar to the party, In charge of the Hellos Academy and all inner city affairs, (events, dealings between nobles, paperwork etc)\n\nOdanra Vilantaro - Dragon born woman head of international relations.\n\nHilfort Binramdunjus - Dwarven man in master of coin. \n\nFenira Xilphana - Wood Elf woman, in charge of agriculture.\n\nAzest Thyless - We know who she is, military and combat training in the ways of Dunamis creating specialized soldiers.\n\nDo the rest actually fucking matter, Ill make shit up that needs to be made up.\n\n\n","x":-580,"y":-280,"width":1000,"height":420}
